WEBVTT

00:00:09.650 --> 00:00:11.800
Who goes there? I'm ready.

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:15.400
Are you the traveler from the maps?
Let us weave our path together.

00:00:33.650 --> 00:00:35.600
I am a shadow in the ticking dark.

00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:39.300
Listen to the gears turn. Farewell.

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:51.800
Ah, here it is.
The focal point of the device.

00:01:44.250 --> 00:01:45.550
The stars are aligned.

00:01:46.600 --> 00:01:50.800
We must follow the ancient path
to find what was lost.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:02.100
Remember this well...

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:05.500
Perfect time stands still.
